  "title": "Spicy Baked Marinated Tofu",
  "description": "Marinate tofu in a mix of rice vinegar, peanut butter, ketchup, garlic, and soy sauce, and discover that tofu really can be tasty!",
  "authors": [
    "Shelley W"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-16T01:48:21-04:00",
